cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this formalization, please cite the versioned software release."
title: "Genuine Zero Uniform Atlas Energy"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Massensini
    given-names: Thiago
license: MIT
version: 0.7.0
date-released: 2026-08-16
abstract: >-
  A Lean 4 formalization of the exact identity between the native real-camera
  and Genuine zero, the unique optimal seeded TFVD radial-defect energy budget,
  the exact empirical C2--C7 camera geometry including the C4/C6 antipodal
  channels, the sharp critical cutoff-tail expansion with an explicit
  M^(-5/2) remainder, and the resulting collective raw-energy expansion with
  rational six-camera leading coefficient and explicit O_t(M^(-4)) error.
  The library also records transverse Hessian geometry, a positive symbolic
  projection floor, and conditional transport of supplied uniform coercivity
  to a supplied limiting energy.
keywords:
  - Lean 4
  - formalized mathematics
  - Genuine continuation
  - carry geometry
  - TFVD
  - Green identity
  - transverse coercivity
  - Hessian
  - primitive camera operator
  - six-camera cutoff operator
  - cutoff-tail asymptotic
  - collective energy asymptotic
  - phase projection
  - uniform atlas
  - critical half-abscissa
  - reproducible proof audit
